      <div>
        <SecHead n="08" label="Depth" id="depth-h">Why the Full Body Cleanse <em>provides the deepest reset.</em></SecHead>
        <div class="mt-7 max-w-xl space-y-5 text-[1.05rem] leading-[1.8] text-ink-soft" data-reveal style="--d:100ms">
          <p>The most important part of any detox program is giving the digestive system a break from solid food.</p>
          <p>Some people worry about the idea of going without solid foods, but the Lemon Detox program is not a traditional fast. A true fast involves complete abstinence from food. The Lemon Detox program instead provides <strong class="text-ink">liquid nourishment</strong>, supplying energy while allowing the body to take a temporary break from digesting solid foods.</p>
          <p>Digesting food requires a significant amount of energy. When solid food is removed from the diet, the body can redirect some of this energy toward its natural cleansing and restorative processes.</p>
        </div>
        <blockquote class="mt-8 max-w-xl rounded-[18px] bg-white p-7 font-serif text-[1.25rem] leading-snug text-ink italic shadow-[0_20px_40px_-30px_rgba(26,26,26,0.35)]" data-reveal style="--d:160ms">
          For this reason, the Full Body Cleanse version, where all meals are replaced with the Lemon Detox drink, provides the most complete cleansing experience.
        </blockquote>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.8] text-ink-soft" data-reveal>While the Relaxed Version allows one healthy meal per day and can still be beneficial, consuming solid food requires the body to continue digesting, which may reduce the depth of the cleanse.</p>
      </div>
