        <span class="grid h-11 w-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-white text-gold-deep" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 8v5M12 16.5v.5M10.3 3.9 2.4 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h15.8a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-sans text-[0.75rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-gold-deep uppercase">Before you start — who it isn’t for</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-[0.98rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">The Lemon Detox Cleanse is not suitable if you are pregnant or breastfeeding; under 18; living with diabetes, heart, kidney or liver disease, or high or low blood pressure; recovering from surgery or illness; living with, or have a history of, an eating disorder; or taking prescription medication (check with your doctor first). If you feel faint, dizzy, unwell or have heart palpitations at any stage, stop and eat normally, and seek medical advice if symptoms continue.</p>
